@startuml deployment-diagram
title Deployment diagram – BrewLite (production: Render, xem ADR-007)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodeStyle rectangle

node "Thiết bị người dùng" as DEV {
  artifact "Trình duyệt / PWA" as BROWSER
}

node "Máy lập trình viên (local)" as LOCAL {
  node "Docker Compose" as COMPOSE {
    artifact "web :3000" as L_WEB
    artifact "api :3001" as L_API
    database "db :5432\nvolume pgdata" as L_DB
  }
}

cloud "GitHub" as GH {
  artifact "Mã nguồn (repo)" as REPO
  node "GitHub Actions" as CI {
    artifact "ci.yml: install, lint, unit test, build" as CIJOB
    artifact "cd.yml: quality, build image, push GHCR,\ndeploy Render, smoke test" as CDJOB
  }
  node "GitHub Secrets / Variables\nSecrets: RENDER_API_DEPLOY_HOOK,\nRENDER_WEB_DEPLOY_HOOK\nVariables: PRODUCTION_API_URL,\nPRODUCTION_WEB_URL" as SECRETS
}

node "GitHub Container Registry (GHCR)\nPackages cần Public nếu Render kéo image không credentials" as REG {
  artifact "ghcr.io/<owner>/brewlite-api:sha-<7 ký tự>" as IMG_API
  artifact "ghcr.io/<owner>/brewlite-web:sha-<7 ký tự>" as IMG_WEB
}

cloud "Render (production)" as PROD {
  node "Web Service (Next.js)\nimage brewlite-web\nPORT 3000" as P_WEB
  node "Web Service (NestJS)\nimage brewlite-api\nPORT 3001\nGET /health" as P_API
  database "Render PostgreSQL\nInternal Database URL\nkhông public" as P_DB
  node "Environment của service\nDATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET,\nFRONTEND_ORIGIN" as P_ENV
  node "Logs và health check" as P_LOG
}

BROWSER --> P_WEB : HTTPS 443
BROWSER --> P_API : HTTPS 443 (REST/JSON, JWT)
P_WEB ..> P_API : gọi API qua NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
P_API --> P_DB : TCP 5432 (mạng nội bộ)
P_ENV ..> P_API
P_API ..> P_LOG
P_WEB ..> P_LOG

REPO --> CIJOB : pull request / push main
REPO --> CDJOB : push tag v* / chạy tay
SECRETS ..> CDJOB
CDJOB --> IMG_API : docker build / push
CDJOB --> IMG_WEB : docker build / push
CDJOB --> P_API : Deploy Hook + imgURL (sha-...)
CDJOB --> P_WEB : Deploy Hook + imgURL (sha-...)
IMG_API ..> P_API : Render kéo image
IMG_WEB ..> P_WEB : Render kéo image

L_WEB --> L_API : HTTP
L_API --> L_DB : TCP 5432
@enduml
